{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 62,
  "name": "雷山小过",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08456",
              "text": "小过：亨，利贞；可小事，不可大事，飞鸟遗之音，不宜上，宜下，大吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08456",
                "bodyParagraph": 8392
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08457",
              "text": "【白话】《小过卦》象征略为过分：小过之时，可致亨通，但应以正为本，故而利于坚守中正之道；可以去干一些小事，但不可去涉足一些大事；飞鸟留下悲鸣之时，不应该向上强飞，而应该向下栖息，如此，大为吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08457",
                "bodyParagraph": 8393
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08458",
              "text": "《象》曰：山上有雷，小过；君子以行过乎恭，丧过乎哀，用过乎俭。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08458",
                "bodyParagraph": 8394
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08459",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《小过卦》的卦象是艮（山）下震（雷）上，为山上响雷之表象，雷声超过了寻常的雷鸣，以此比喻“小有过越”，君子应效法“小过”之象，在一些寻常小事上能略有过分，如行止时过分恭敬，遇到丧事时过分悲哀，日常用度过分节俭，为的是矫枉过正。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08459",
                "bodyParagraph": 8395
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08461",
              "text": "小过卦震上艮下，山上有雷，声音大于平常，却只宜处理小事。“可小事，不可大事；不宜上，宜下，大吉”，强调凡事适度，不好高骛远。《象》曰“君子以行过乎恭，丧过乎哀，用过乎俭”，说的是在日常小事上可以谨慎有余。经商宜小规模试探，事业宜稳扎稳打，不可因急于求成而越界。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08461",
                "bodyParagraph": 8397
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08464",
              "text": "初六，飞鸟以凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08464",
                "bodyParagraph": 8400
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08465",
              "text": "【白话】初六，飞鸟向上强飞将会出现凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08465",
                "bodyParagraph": 8401
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08466",
              "text": "《象》曰：“飞鸟以凶”，不可如何也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08466",
                "bodyParagraph": 8402
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08467",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“飞鸟向上强飞将会出现凶险”，是咎由自取，无可奈何。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08467",
                "bodyParagraph": 8403
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08469",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08469",
                "bodyParagraph": 8405
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08471",
              "text": "初六爻动，变为第55卦《丰卦》（雷火丰）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08471",
                "bodyParagraph": 8407
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08473",
              "text": "初六“飞鸟以凶”，羽翼未丰却欲强飞，提醒人在能力尚不足时切勿好高骛远。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08473",
                "bodyParagraph": 8409
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08476",
              "text": "六二，过其祖，遇其妣；不及其君，遇其臣，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08476",
                "bodyParagraph": 8412
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08477",
              "text": "【白话】六二，超过祖父，遇到祖母；但不能擅自越过君位，君臣遇合，一定没有祸患。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08477",
                "bodyParagraph": 8413
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08478",
              "text": "《象》曰：“不及其君”，臣不可过也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08478",
                "bodyParagraph": 8414
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08479",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不能擅自越过君位”，因为作为臣子是不能超越至尊的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08479",
                "bodyParagraph": 8415
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08481",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08481",
                "bodyParagraph": 8417
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08483",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第32卦《恒卦》（雷风恒）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08483",
                "bodyParagraph": 8419
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08485",
              "text": "六二“过其祖，遇其妣；不及其君，遇其臣，无咎”，过而有节、知道身份边界和请示的适当对象，便可无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08485",
                "bodyParagraph": 8421
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08488",
              "text": "九三，弗过防之，从或戕之，凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08488",
                "bodyParagraph": 8424
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08489",
              "text": "【白话】九三，自恃强盛而不愿过分防备，从而将要为人所害，故有凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08489",
                "bodyParagraph": 8425
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08490",
              "text": "《象》曰：“从或戕之”，凶如何也！",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08490",
                "bodyParagraph": 8426
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08491",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“将要为人所害”，说明面临的危险是多么的严重啊！",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08491",
                "bodyParagraph": 8427
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08493",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08493",
                "bodyParagraph": 8429
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08495",
              "text": "九三爻动，变为第16卦《豫卦》（雷地豫）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08495",
                "bodyParagraph": 8431
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08497",
              "text": "九三“弗过防之，从或戕之，凶”，不能因自恃刚强而疏于防范，否则易被人所害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08497",
                "bodyParagraph": 8433
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08500",
              "text": "九四，无咎，弗过遇之；往厉必戒，勿用，永贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08500",
                "bodyParagraph": 8436
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08501",
              "text": "【白话】九四，没有祸患，不过分恃强恃刚就能遇到陰柔；但是主动迎合陰柔会有凶险，因此，务必心存戒惕，不能去施展才用，要永远守中正之道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08501",
                "bodyParagraph": 8437
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08502",
              "text": "《象》曰：“弗过遇之”，位不当也；“往厉必戒”，终不可长也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08502",
                "bodyParagraph": 8438
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08503",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不过分恃强恃刚就能遇到陰柔”，因为九四爻以刚居柔位，位置不正；“主动迎合陰柔会有凶险，务必要心存戒惕”，是说若主动迎合陰柔，最终将不可能长久无害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08503",
                "bodyParagraph": 8439
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08505",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08505",
                "bodyParagraph": 8441
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08507",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第15卦《谦卦》（地山谦）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08507",
                "bodyParagraph": 8443
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08509",
              "text": "九四“无咎，弗过遇之；往厉必戒，勿用永贞”，不强求与人相遇，戒备贸然前进，守住分寸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08509",
                "bodyParagraph": 8445
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08512",
              "text": "六五，密云不雨，自我西郊；公弋取彼在穴。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08512",
                "bodyParagraph": 8448
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08513",
              "text": "【白话】六五，乌云密布在天空而不下雨，这些乌云是从城的西边飘过来的；王公们用细绳系在箭上射取那些藏在穴中的野兽。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08513",
                "bodyParagraph": 8449
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08514",
              "text": "《象》曰：密云不雨，已上也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08514",
                "bodyParagraph": 8450
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08515",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“乌云密布在天空而不下雨”，是因为陰气超过了陽气，陰陽不合，故而不能化雨。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08515",
                "bodyParagraph": 8451
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08517",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08517",
                "bodyParagraph": 8453
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08519",
              "text": "六五爻动，变为第31卦《咸卦》（泽山咸）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08519",
                "bodyParagraph": 8455
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08521",
              "text": "六五“密云不雨，自我西郊；公弋取彼在穴”，虽见机会酝酿却尚未落实，应寻访能人、积蓄条件，不急于宣称成效。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08521",
                "bodyParagraph": 8457
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08524",
              "text": "上六，弗遇过之；飞鸟离之，凶，是谓灾眚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08524",
                "bodyParagraph": 8460
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08525",
              "text": "【白话】上六，不能遇合陽刚却超越了陽刚，无安栖之所的飞鸟遭受射杀之祸，故而凶险，这就叫做灾殃祸患。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08525",
                "bodyParagraph": 8461
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08526",
              "text": "《象》曰：“弗遇过之”，已亢也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08526",
                "bodyParagraph": 8462
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08527",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“不能遇合陽刚而超越了陽刚”，是指其过分已达到极点，再危险不过了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08527",
                "bodyParagraph": 8463
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08529",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08529",
                "bodyParagraph": 8465
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08531",
              "text": "上六爻动，变为第56卦《旅卦》（火山旅）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08531",
                "bodyParagraph": 8467
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08533",
              "text": "上六“弗遇过之，飞鸟离之，凶，是谓灾眚”，一味超越限度会陷入罗网般的危险，极处须知退守。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08533",
                "bodyParagraph": 8469
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
